            "level": {
              "value": 1
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You are adept at disguising coded messages as folksy idioms. Using slang, jokes, halfling loanwords, and the like, you convey a simple message consisting of three basic words (such as \"Danger assassin flee\" or \"Meet me moonrise\"). Your intended listener can attempt a DC 20 Perception check to discern the message.\n\nThis DC is reduced by 5 if the listener is a halfling or has Folksy Patter, or by 10 if both apply. Eavesdroppers can also attempt a Perception check against your Deception DC to discern your meaning. Any bonuses or penalties to Perception checks to Sense Motive apply to checks to understand Folksy Patter."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
